### All books
GET {{baseUrl}}/books

### One book with reviews and average rating
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/1

### A book without reviews: averageRating null, reviews []
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/5

### Unknown book (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/999


### ---------- Open Library search ----------

### Search
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/search?q=tolkien

### Search with spaces (encoded by the client)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/search?q=lord of the rings

### Missing q (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/search


### ---------- Import ----------

### Import The Hobbit (201 the first time, 200 after that)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/import/OL27482W

### Unknown key (404 from Open Library)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/import/OL999999999W

### Invalid key format (404, never reaches Open Library)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/import/hello